# Local environment. Only .env.example is committed.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# `public/killtest.json` is deliberately NOT ignored. The deployed console cannot run
# the kill test, so it must render a committed measurement — written by the test that
# measured it, carrying its own `ran_at`, and regenerated by `make killtest` and by CI.
#
# Deliberately not committed: a checked-in result would be a number this console asserts rather
# than one a run measured. ADR-001 requires every figure a reader sees to come from a script they
# can run themselves. Until a run writes it, the screen says the test has not been run.
